WEBVTT

00:00:01.490 --> 00:00:03.490
Previously on Smallville.

00:00:03.490 --> 00:00:05.490
They are too late, Kala.

00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:06.490
Lana?

00:00:06.490 --> 00:00:08.490
Miss Lang had a full recovery.

00:00:08.490 --> 00:00:09.490
Where is she?

00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:11.490
Oh, she's already checked out.

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:13.490
But she wanted me to give you this.

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:17.489
I knew that if I looked into your eyes, I'd never be able to say it.

00:00:17.489 --> 00:00:21.489
If I ever discovered that someone withheld information that could help me find Lex,

00:00:21.489 --> 00:00:23.489
I'd be forced to respond accordingly.

00:00:23.489 --> 00:00:25.489
Nobody questions my loyalty.

00:00:25.489 --> 00:00:29.489
I can't believe it. Lana, you're back.

00:00:29.489 --> 00:00:30.489
Why are you staying?

00:00:30.489 --> 00:00:32.490
Leaving's harder than I thought it would be.

00:00:32.490 --> 00:00:35.490
You still haven't told him the reasons why you disappeared.

00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:37.490
Or what you plan on doing next?

00:00:37.490 --> 00:00:42.600
Lex saved my life. I owe him everything.

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.600
This is how a Luther rewards that kind of loyalty.

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:50.600
You've been Lex's eyes and ears for quite some time.

00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:54.600
I've done everything, but not anymore.

00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:56.600
Goodbye, Lex.

00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:58.600
The rest of the world didn't have to come first.

00:00:58.600 --> 00:00:59.600
The world needs you, Clark.

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:01.600
What about what we need?

00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:18.819
Sir.

00:01:18.819 --> 00:01:21.819
It's not too late to suspend the procedure.

00:01:21.819 --> 00:01:23.819
Our orders are to move forward.

00:01:23.819 --> 00:01:24.819
At what cost?

00:01:24.819 --> 00:01:27.819
I know Mr. Luthor wants to get back on his feet as soon as possible,

00:01:27.819 --> 00:01:31.819
but we are nowhere near ready to attempt us on a human being.

00:01:31.819 --> 00:01:33.819
The studies on mice have barely even started.

00:01:33.819 --> 00:01:37.819
Doesn't matter. Mr. Luther wants us to proceed, and that's what we're going to do.

00:01:37.819 --> 00:01:40.819
Where are we with a molecular transfusion?

00:01:40.819 --> 00:01:41.819
Prepared for absorption.

00:01:41.819 --> 00:01:45.819
In the subject? Vital's normal. We're all set.

00:01:45.819 --> 00:02:00.909
Begin the transdermal evisceration.

00:02:00.909 --> 00:02:10.710
Gizing.

00:02:10.710 --> 00:04:01.180
You know you're bored when you resort to watching a repeat of your breakup.

00:04:01.180 --> 00:04:06.669
I needed to remind myself that Lana left for a reason.

00:04:06.669 --> 00:04:11.370
Did something happen that made you suddenly forget?

00:04:11.370 --> 00:04:20.180
Last night, we kind of kissed.

00:04:20.180 --> 00:04:24.980
It was a mistake. I don't know what I was thinking.

00:04:24.980 --> 00:04:28.980
Clarke, you're acting like you committed a crime.

00:04:28.980 --> 00:04:33.980
Now, I'm not a lawyer, but I really don't think that a little trip to first base is exactly a felony.

00:04:33.980 --> 00:04:36.980
I'm digging up feelings from the past that need to stay buried.

00:04:36.980 --> 00:04:37.980
For both our sake.

00:04:37.980 --> 00:04:38.980
You know, you have...

00:04:38.980 --> 00:04:40.980
an arsenal of abilities at your disposal,

00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:42.980
but suffocating feelings that want to come up for air

00:04:42.980 --> 00:04:46.259
definitely isn't one of them.

00:04:46.259 --> 00:04:48.259
Lana thought she was holding me back, and you know what?

00:04:48.259 --> 00:04:49.259
She was right.

00:04:49.259 --> 00:04:50.259
Look what happened after she left.

00:04:50.259 --> 00:04:52.259
I got off the farm, I got a job, I started using my abilities

00:04:52.259 --> 00:04:54.259
to help people when they needed it the most.

00:04:54.259 --> 00:04:56.259
Did you do that because Lana left

00:04:56.259 --> 00:04:58.259
or because you simply grew up and realized

00:04:58.259 --> 00:05:01.819
what you wanted to do with your life?

00:05:01.819 --> 00:05:04.819
Clark, maybe she isn't the liability you're making her out to be.

00:05:04.819 --> 00:05:06.819
How does she feel about it?

00:05:06.819 --> 00:05:08.819
It's on that disc. She doesn't want to be together.

00:05:08.819 --> 00:05:10.819
She made that disc seven months ago, Clark.

00:05:10.819 --> 00:05:11.819
People change.

00:05:11.819 --> 00:05:13.819
You certainly did.

00:05:13.819 --> 00:05:16.819
Look, stop playing the guessing game and talk to her.

00:05:16.819 --> 00:05:19.819
She's probably at my apartment right now.

00:05:19.819 --> 00:05:45.699
Clerk, I didn't know it was you.

00:05:45.699 --> 00:05:48.699
I didn't realize that breaking and entering was one of your hobbies.

00:05:48.699 --> 00:05:50.699
The damage was done when I got here.

00:05:50.699 --> 00:05:53.699
Okay, I was worried about Lana, and I came to warn her,

00:05:53.699 --> 00:05:55.699
but I was obviously too late.

00:05:55.699 --> 00:05:57.699
Warn her about what?

00:05:57.699 --> 00:06:03.699
It seems that she's been poking around some classified Luther Corp technology.

00:06:03.699 --> 00:06:11.100
The last time I changed.

00:06:11.100 --> 00:06:13.100
You were in charge of Luther Corp.

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:18.100
Everything but the nanotechnology dedicated to sustaining Lex's life.

00:06:18.100 --> 00:06:24.100
The bear may be hibernating, but that does not mean that he's going to sit around and let his honey get stolen.

00:06:24.100 --> 00:06:26.100
You think Lex is behind what happened to Lana?

00:06:26.100 --> 00:06:29.100
I don't think, Clark. I know.

00:06:29.100 --> 00:06:31.100
And I am really concerned for her.

00:06:31.100 --> 00:06:34.100
Since when did you and Lana become close friends?

00:06:34.100 --> 00:06:36.100
I will forever be grateful to her.

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:40.100
Lana is responsible for finally showing me the monster that Lex really is.

00:06:40.100 --> 00:06:44.100
Lex really is. The least that I can do is repay the favor.

00:06:44.100 --> 00:06:50.420
I knew Lex was still alive. I had no idea he was capable of kidnapping Lana from a distance.

00:06:50.420 --> 00:06:52.420
It wouldn't be the first time he's abducted her from afar.

00:06:52.420 --> 00:06:58.029
She didn't tell you.

00:06:58.029 --> 00:07:01.600
Tell me what?

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:05.879
Do you remember that DVD she made for you last spring?

00:07:05.879 --> 00:07:08.879
Did you ever wonder how Lana got her hands on a video camera

00:07:08.879 --> 00:07:11.879
right after she awoke from a deep coma?

00:07:11.879 --> 00:07:15.879
As long as I'm in your life, I'm holding you back.

00:07:15.879 --> 00:07:19.120
Please.

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:22.120
For both of us, don't come looking for me.

00:07:22.120 --> 00:07:29.819
More than you will ever know.

00:07:29.819 --> 00:07:36.550
Now let me go.

00:07:36.550 --> 00:07:38.550
It's for your own protection, ma'am.

00:07:38.550 --> 00:07:39.550
Is that what Lex told you?

00:07:39.550 --> 00:07:42.550
You've been in a coma for the past three months.

00:07:42.550 --> 00:07:44.550
We're here to make sure you stay safe.

00:07:44.550 --> 00:07:45.550
Help!

00:07:45.550 --> 00:07:53.620
Get her in the van. I'll meet you at the compound.

00:07:53.620 --> 00:07:55.620
That test was a lie.

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:58.620
Lana never wanted to leave. She left because she was escaping from you.

00:07:58.620 --> 00:07:59.620
Clark.

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:00.620
You know better than Lex.

00:08:00.620 --> 00:08:02.620
If I had known what I know now, I would have never been part of it.

00:08:02.620 --> 00:08:04.620
would have never been part of it.

00:08:04.620 --> 00:08:06.120
Lex convinced us it was for her own good.

00:08:06.120 --> 00:08:08.120
I'm nice of him to kidnap her.

00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:11.120
Lex also said that she was in that asylum because of you.

00:08:11.120 --> 00:08:13.620
That your relationship was so dysfunctional.

00:08:13.620 --> 00:08:29.220
You are constantly hurting her.

00:08:29.220 --> 00:08:30.720
Where are you taking me?

00:08:30.720 --> 00:08:32.720
To a place where he'll be protected.

00:08:32.720 --> 00:08:40.460
I hear him.

00:08:40.460 --> 00:08:42.960
Lex has been watching me, hasn't he?

00:08:42.960 --> 00:08:45.960
Waiting for me to wake up so he can kidnap me.

00:08:45.960 --> 00:08:47.960
Mr. Luthor just wants to help you.

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:54.509
Not feeling very well.

00:08:54.509 --> 00:08:55.509
You're dehydrated.

00:08:55.509 --> 00:08:56.509
You should drink down.

00:08:56.509 --> 00:08:57.509
I don't know.

00:08:57.509 --> 00:08:59.509
I think I'm gonna throw up.

00:08:59.509 --> 00:09:07.519
Yeah.

00:09:07.519 --> 00:09:08.519
Wait, wait.

00:09:08.519 --> 00:09:10.519
Just calm down!

00:09:10.519 --> 00:09:20.210
Leave the keys in the ignition and get out of the van.

00:09:20.210 --> 00:10:51.870
Now!

00:10:51.870 --> 00:10:52.870
Could have used them again.

00:10:52.870 --> 00:10:53.870
What are their names?

00:10:53.870 --> 00:10:57.309
What are their names?

00:10:57.309 --> 00:10:58.309
They're both dead.

00:10:58.309 --> 00:11:05.009
The people Lex employs now are brand new.

00:11:05.009 --> 00:11:07.009
Without any ties to his past.

00:11:07.009 --> 00:11:31.440
What are you got there, Clark?

00:11:31.440 --> 00:11:36.289
I'm not sure what it is.

00:11:36.289 --> 00:11:42.129
Doesn't seem like Lana's taste.

00:11:42.129 --> 00:11:45.720
It's not.

00:11:45.720 --> 00:11:46.720
Have you seen this before?

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:54.039
My strategic advisor, Carter Beaufort, it's his.

00:11:54.039 --> 00:12:10.149
What did you do with Lana?

00:12:10.149 --> 00:12:12.149
I don't know who you're talking about.

00:12:12.149 --> 00:12:14.149
Don't lie to me!

00:12:14.149 --> 00:12:16.149
I found you medallion in her apartment!

00:12:16.149 --> 00:12:21.909
My medallion is right here.

00:12:21.909 --> 00:12:29.440
Exactly the same.

00:12:29.440 --> 00:12:31.440
How do you know, Lana?

00:12:31.440 --> 00:12:34.440
Some. I suggest you back down right now.

00:12:34.440 --> 00:12:38.139
Lana has been kidnapped.

00:12:38.139 --> 00:12:40.139
Look, if anything you know may help me find her, please.

00:12:40.139 --> 00:12:42.139
Please.

00:12:42.139 --> 00:12:43.139
You can trust me.

00:12:43.139 --> 00:12:47.350
You must be Clark.

00:12:47.350 --> 00:12:49.350
How do you know my name?

00:12:49.350 --> 00:12:55.590
I gave Lana that medallion last spring in Edge City.

00:12:55.590 --> 00:13:00.190
I don't know how she tracked me down.

00:13:00.190 --> 00:13:01.190
But she did.

00:13:01.190 --> 00:13:03.190
Money means nothing to me.

00:13:03.190 --> 00:13:05.190
I'll pay you whatever you want.

00:13:05.190 --> 00:13:11.860
I don't need your dollars, ma'am.

00:13:11.860 --> 00:13:15.860
Just a retired teacher living off his pension.

00:13:15.860 --> 00:13:19.860
A teacher who trained green berets and navy seals

00:13:19.860 --> 00:13:20.860
to withstand extreme.

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:22.860
pain and torture.

00:13:22.860 --> 00:13:23.860
I've done my homework.

00:13:23.860 --> 00:13:36.360
I need your help.

00:13:36.360 --> 00:13:38.360
What I have to teach, you're not ready to learn.

00:13:38.360 --> 00:13:40.360
You'd be surprised.

00:13:40.360 --> 00:13:42.360
Please just give me a chance.

00:13:42.360 --> 00:13:45.360
Well, you're not a soldier and you're definitely not a government agent,

00:13:45.360 --> 00:13:47.360
so why are you here?

00:13:47.360 --> 00:13:49.360
I want to be invincible.

00:13:49.360 --> 00:13:53.309
Oh, good for you.

00:13:53.309 --> 00:13:57.840
Look, I'm all for girl power.

00:13:57.840 --> 00:14:01.840
You're gonna have to go find you on your own, okay, sweetheart?

00:14:01.840 --> 00:14:03.840
I'm not asking you, but I'm telling you.

00:14:03.840 --> 00:14:04.840
I'm telling you.

00:14:04.840 --> 00:14:11.960
If you help me, I promise you'll be helping the world.

00:14:11.960 --> 00:14:27.809
You were barely under.

00:14:27.809 --> 00:14:31.919
It's too cold.

00:14:31.919 --> 00:14:32.919
You're weaker than I thought.

00:14:32.919 --> 00:14:36.919
Yeah, well, life hasn't exactly been a walk in the park lately.

00:14:36.919 --> 00:14:39.919
Oh, poor, poor pitiful you.

00:14:39.919 --> 00:14:42.919
How long you've been feeling sorry for yourself?

00:14:42.919 --> 00:14:44.919
Let me guess.

00:14:44.919 --> 00:14:56.679
Your entire life.

00:14:56.679 --> 00:14:57.679
You tortured her?

00:14:57.679 --> 00:14:58.679
I trained her.

00:14:58.679 --> 00:14:59.679
That's how she came back stronger.

00:14:59.679 --> 00:15:01.679
She's always been strong.

00:15:01.679 --> 00:15:02.679
Now she's missing.

00:15:02.679 --> 00:15:03.679
Because of you.

00:15:03.679 --> 00:15:07.679
All I did was help her get over the one thing that was holding her back.

00:15:07.679 --> 00:15:09.679
What are you waiting for?

00:15:09.679 --> 00:15:12.679
I'm just not used to scorching myself.

00:15:12.679 --> 00:15:13.679
Getting used to it.

00:15:13.679 --> 00:15:26.080
No fear.

00:15:26.080 --> 00:15:27.080
No pain.

00:15:27.080 --> 00:15:42.519
I can't.

00:15:42.519 --> 00:15:47.470
It's not fear that's stopping you, is it?

00:15:47.470 --> 00:15:51.470
You're holding on to something or someone.

00:15:51.470 --> 00:15:54.879
Do you see anyone else here?

00:15:54.879 --> 00:15:56.879
Oh, I can feel them.

00:15:56.879 --> 00:15:59.879
So can you.

00:15:59.879 --> 00:16:00.879
As long as you're trying to be.

00:16:00.879 --> 00:16:02.879
be someone you're not.

00:16:02.879 --> 00:16:04.879
You are going to be vulnerable.

00:16:04.879 --> 00:16:06.879
You're going to feel the pain.

00:16:06.879 --> 00:16:12.169
What's the name?

00:16:12.169 --> 00:16:14.169
His name's Clark.

00:16:14.169 --> 00:16:16.169
And if I had an ounce of his strength.

00:16:16.169 --> 00:16:19.169
I am not training you to be like someone else.

00:16:19.169 --> 00:16:23.840
I'm training you to be Lana Lang.

00:16:23.840 --> 00:16:25.840
To rise from the ashes of your previous life.

00:16:25.840 --> 00:16:27.840
Stronger.

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:29.840
More powerful.

00:16:29.840 --> 00:16:36.250
Fearless.

00:16:36.250 --> 00:16:37.250
It's time to rise.

00:16:37.250 --> 00:17:23.859
You don't look ready for class.

00:17:23.859 --> 00:17:28.859
Carter, I have learned so much from you.

00:17:28.859 --> 00:17:31.859
But what I need, I can't get it here.

00:17:31.859 --> 00:17:33.859
What you need are skills, Lange.

00:17:33.859 --> 00:17:35.859
Surety.

00:17:35.859 --> 00:17:37.859
I need power.

00:17:37.859 --> 00:17:43.119
You'll have it.

00:17:43.119 --> 00:17:47.450
But it just doesn't happen overnight.

00:17:47.450 --> 00:17:49.450
I've had it before.

00:17:49.450 --> 00:17:53.450
Skills and abilities beyond what you can imagine.

00:17:53.450 --> 00:17:55.450
But I wasn't ready for them.

00:17:55.450 --> 00:17:58.450
Physically, mentally or emotionally.

00:17:58.450 --> 00:17:59.450
And now?

00:17:59.450 --> 00:18:02.450
And now, thanks to you, I am.

00:18:02.450 --> 00:18:07.779
It's thirst for power, Lana.

00:18:07.779 --> 00:18:09.779
I've seen it before.

00:18:09.779 --> 00:18:14.380
Most of the time, it doesn't have a happy ending.

00:18:14.380 --> 00:18:36.259
Before you fly off to change the world,

00:18:36.259 --> 00:18:37.259
I've got something for you.

00:18:37.259 --> 00:18:41.599
I don't deserve it.

00:18:41.599 --> 00:18:43.599
Take this so you'll always remember.

00:18:43.599 --> 00:18:48.599
As you rise higher and higher, never look down.

00:18:48.599 --> 00:19:00.130
After Edge City, where'd she go?

00:19:00.130 --> 00:19:01.130
Entropolis.

00:19:01.130 --> 00:19:07.809
She was so full of hope.

00:19:07.809 --> 00:19:08.809
Wanted to imprint this side.

00:19:08.809 --> 00:19:10.809
stamp of positivity on the world.

00:19:10.809 --> 00:19:12.809
I couldn't let anything happen to her.

00:19:12.809 --> 00:19:14.809
For all the death and destruction,

00:19:14.809 --> 00:19:15.809
I've been responsible for,

00:19:15.809 --> 00:19:18.809
Lana was my chance of redemption, so I tracked her down.

00:19:18.809 --> 00:19:21.809
And you found her, what was she doing?

00:19:21.809 --> 00:19:23.809
Investigating Luther Court.

00:19:23.809 --> 00:19:25.809
I told her to put it in the past, but she wouldn't listen to me.

00:19:25.809 --> 00:19:27.809
So I joined her cause.

00:19:27.809 --> 00:19:31.809
Keep an eye on her, and I got this job on the inside,

00:19:31.809 --> 00:19:34.809
feeding Lana information while I advised Tess Mercer

00:19:34.809 --> 00:19:36.809
on defense contract strategies.

00:19:36.809 --> 00:19:40.950
Did Lana contact?

00:19:40.950 --> 00:19:42.950
contact anyone else when she was in Metropolis.

00:19:42.950 --> 00:19:45.950
A blonde woman.

00:19:45.950 --> 00:19:47.950
They went to high school together in Smallville.

00:19:47.950 --> 00:19:49.950
Chloe? Sullivan.

00:19:49.950 --> 00:20:01.609
Sir, she's barely alive.

00:20:01.609 --> 00:20:03.609
It's the only way to apply the nanites.

00:20:03.609 --> 00:20:07.690
Begin the grafting.

00:20:07.690 --> 00:20:17.119
Applying the Prometheus layer.

00:20:17.119 --> 00:20:55.130
The cloak and dagger existence suits you well, Regan.

00:20:55.130 --> 00:20:57.130
So how's the new career?

00:20:57.130 --> 00:20:59.130
Breaking and entering?

00:20:59.130 --> 00:21:03.130
Did you find what you were looking for in Lana Lang's apartment?

00:21:03.130 --> 00:21:04.130
Still looking?

00:21:04.130 --> 00:21:06.130
just like you.

00:21:06.130 --> 00:21:08.130
Only I'm trying to find the technology

00:21:08.130 --> 00:21:11.130
to keep Lex alive, not to destroy it.

00:21:11.130 --> 00:21:13.130
The world already believes he's dead.

00:21:13.130 --> 00:21:16.130
I'm just trying to make a fantasy or reality.

00:21:16.130 --> 00:21:19.130
You actually believe you can declare Lex Luther dead

00:21:19.130 --> 00:21:23.369
and not end up dead yourself?

00:21:23.369 --> 00:21:25.369
You're a pretty pathetic guard dog,

00:21:25.369 --> 00:21:30.359
loyal to a master that can't even feed himself.

00:21:30.359 --> 00:21:32.359
Why don't you come and work for me?

00:21:32.359 --> 00:21:33.359
Hmm?

00:21:33.359 --> 00:21:37.890
I'll give you more milk bones than Lex ever did.

00:21:37.890 --> 00:21:39.869
I think I'd rather

00:21:39.890 --> 00:21:41.890
Rather shovel, Caledong.

00:21:41.890 --> 00:21:44.890
Oh, you see, it's not really a choice.

00:21:44.890 --> 00:21:57.279
Once you discover that Prometheus technology, I want you to bring it to me.

00:21:57.279 --> 00:21:59.279
I'm afraid then.

00:21:59.279 --> 00:22:06.329
You're going to be waiting.

00:22:06.329 --> 00:22:09.329
Find me the Prometheus technology.

00:22:09.329 --> 00:22:12.329
Or I'll have to take it by force.

00:22:12.329 --> 00:22:24.960
Pull her out and get her quarantined.

00:22:24.960 --> 00:22:37.980
The entertainment procedures, asthma teams standing by.

00:22:37.980 --> 00:22:49.890
Full soon.

00:22:49.890 --> 00:22:52.890
No more super scares, please. I'm this close to a cardiac arrest.

00:22:52.890 --> 00:22:53.890
Why didn't you tell you?

00:22:53.890 --> 00:22:56.890
So now I'm keeping secrets I didn't know I was keeping.

00:22:56.890 --> 00:22:57.890
Lana.

00:22:57.890 --> 00:22:59.890
How could you not tell me you spoke to her?

00:22:59.890 --> 00:23:03.720
Because she asked me not to.

00:23:03.720 --> 00:23:05.720
I have to respect that.

00:23:05.720 --> 00:23:08.720
Now it looks like your respect?

00:23:08.720 --> 00:23:10.720
It may have gotten her kidnapped.

00:23:10.720 --> 00:23:11.720
What?

00:23:11.720 --> 00:23:13.720
Chloe, if I'd have known what she was doing,

00:23:13.720 --> 00:23:14.720
I could have stopped her before she got hurt.

00:23:14.720 --> 00:23:16.720
I wasn't about to betray her trust clerk,

00:23:16.720 --> 00:23:17.720
just like I would never betray yours.

00:23:17.720 --> 00:23:19.720
You of all people should understand that.

00:23:19.720 --> 00:23:21.720
This is different, Chloe.

00:23:21.720 --> 00:23:23.720
I have abilities I can take care of myself.

00:23:23.720 --> 00:23:24.720
Lana can't!

00:23:24.720 --> 00:23:32.480
All that matters now is finding her.

00:23:32.480 --> 00:23:36.480
Please, you have to tell me everything she said to you.

00:23:36.480 --> 00:23:42.779
Okay, first of all, just so you know, she didn't come back to see me.

00:23:42.779 --> 00:23:44.779
She was on a mission.

00:23:44.779 --> 00:23:53.970
Am I hallucinating or is that the long-lost Lana Lang in front of me?

00:23:53.970 --> 00:23:54.970
Hi, Chloe.

00:23:54.970 --> 00:23:55.970
Hi.

00:23:55.970 --> 00:23:57.970
Oh my God.

00:23:57.970 --> 00:24:00.970
I thought I'd never see you again, now you're back.

00:24:00.970 --> 00:24:03.970
Actually, I'm only here for a short stay.

00:24:03.970 --> 00:24:04.970
I am so...

00:24:04.970 --> 00:24:07.970
I'm so impressed with what you've done with Isis, Chloe.

00:24:07.970 --> 00:24:11.970
You've turned my dinky little operation into a place that really helps people.

00:24:11.970 --> 00:24:14.970
I'm just carrying on the torch you lit.

00:24:14.970 --> 00:24:18.970
In other late breaking news, I'm getting married next month.

00:24:18.970 --> 00:24:19.970
Wow.

00:24:19.970 --> 00:24:21.970
That is a huge headline.

00:24:21.970 --> 00:24:23.970
I am so happy for you.

00:24:23.970 --> 00:24:26.970
You two make a perfect couple.

00:24:26.970 --> 00:24:31.970
Speaking of which, does your short stay include a pit stop at the planet to see Clark?

00:24:31.970 --> 00:24:33.970
Not this time.

00:24:33.970 --> 00:24:34.970
time.

00:24:34.970 --> 00:24:39.970
But I read that about the red-blue blur saving the citizens of Metropolis.

00:24:39.970 --> 00:24:44.970
I've got to say that when I saw that article, it brought tears to my eyes.

00:24:44.970 --> 00:24:50.490
I am so proud of him.

00:24:50.490 --> 00:24:54.490
I know that you miss all of us, but something tells me there's more to your trip back home

00:24:54.490 --> 00:24:56.490
than simply checking in with the old gang.

00:24:56.490 --> 00:25:03.119
I actually came back here to find out more about Project Aries.

00:25:03.119 --> 00:25:05.119
Project Aries.

00:25:05.119 --> 00:25:09.119
Wasn't that Lexus scheme to genetically enhance injured soldiers?

00:25:09.119 --> 00:25:11.119
Using alien DNA.

00:25:11.119 --> 00:25:17.759
Lana, this is all in the past. Lex is out of your life now.

00:25:17.759 --> 00:25:20.759
Why don't you just put this behind you and move on?

00:25:20.759 --> 00:25:24.420
I am moving on.

00:25:24.420 --> 00:25:25.420
Really?

00:25:25.420 --> 00:25:28.420
Because it seems to me like you're not just playing with fire.

00:25:28.420 --> 00:25:30.420
You're stepping into a raging inferno.

00:25:30.420 --> 00:25:32.420
Clark should know about this.

00:25:32.420 --> 00:25:36.420
I plan on telling Clark when the time is right.

00:25:36.420 --> 00:25:41.670
Chloe, Chloe, I want you to promise me that you won't say a word.

00:25:41.670 --> 00:25:48.920
I can take care of myself now.

00:25:48.920 --> 00:25:49.920
All I did was honor my friend C.

00:25:49.920 --> 00:25:53.920
was honor my friend's secret, and now I feel like this is all my fault.

00:25:53.920 --> 00:25:55.920
Must have been the way she wanted it.

00:25:55.920 --> 00:25:58.920
So she could do what she had to do without anyone getting in her way.

00:25:58.920 --> 00:26:00.920
Especially me.

00:26:00.920 --> 00:26:02.920
Did you check on Project Airs after she left?

00:26:02.920 --> 00:26:04.920
Yeah, it turns out the project was mothballed over a year ago,

00:26:04.920 --> 00:26:06.920
even before Lex went missing.

00:26:06.920 --> 00:26:09.920
Tess Mercer told me, Lana's been looking into technology that could keep Lex alive.

00:26:09.920 --> 00:26:11.920
She thinks that Lex abducted her.

00:26:11.920 --> 00:26:14.920
Since when are you trusting what the First Lady of Luther Corp has to say?

00:26:14.920 --> 00:26:15.920
So she came clean with me.

00:26:15.920 --> 00:26:17.920
She told me when Lana made that disc,

00:26:17.920 --> 00:26:18.920
she was being held at gunpoint by team of Lex's men.

00:26:18.920 --> 00:26:20.920
by team of Lex's men, led by Tess.

00:26:20.920 --> 00:26:21.920
Wait, Clerk.

00:26:21.920 --> 00:26:24.920
If Lana didn't make that disc on her own,

00:26:24.920 --> 00:26:26.920
then why didn't she come home to you?

00:26:26.920 --> 00:26:32.230
She was too busy planning her revenge on Lex.

00:26:32.230 --> 00:26:33.230
Chloe?

00:26:33.230 --> 00:26:36.230
I need to find Lana before she does something, she regret.

00:26:36.230 --> 00:26:52.279
It's a ballsy move sitting in the boss's chair.

00:26:52.279 --> 00:26:54.279
Either you have good news from me

00:26:54.279 --> 00:26:57.279
or you like to live dangerously close to the edge.

00:26:57.279 --> 00:27:14.069
I guess it's the latter.

00:27:14.069 --> 00:27:15.069
You did have good news for you.

00:27:15.069 --> 00:27:17.069
The address of the Prometheus lab.

00:27:17.069 --> 00:27:20.509
Unfortunately, he told you

00:27:20.509 --> 00:27:22.509
told me first.

00:27:22.509 --> 00:27:29.099
So working for Lex gives you carte blanche to kill innocent people.

00:27:29.099 --> 00:27:30.099
Innocent?

00:27:30.099 --> 00:27:32.099
He worked for you, Tess.

00:27:32.099 --> 00:27:36.099
Give a mid-level bureaucrat a little bit of power and it goes straight to his head.

00:27:36.099 --> 00:27:39.099
You're the expert.

00:27:39.099 --> 00:27:43.099
You know, I actually used to be envious of you.

00:27:43.099 --> 00:27:46.099
Of course, that was before I found out Lex was using you.

00:27:46.099 --> 00:27:48.099
As his eyes and ears.

00:27:48.099 --> 00:27:53.039
I happen to have my own eyes and ears.

00:27:53.039 --> 00:27:55.039
Hidden in the security cameras in this office.

00:27:55.039 --> 00:27:57.039
in this office.

00:27:57.039 --> 00:27:59.039
Not only did they record your illuminating conversation

00:27:59.039 --> 00:28:03.039
with my security guard, but also his tragic murder.

00:28:03.039 --> 00:28:05.039
Yeah.

00:28:05.039 --> 00:28:09.039
But that footage is nothing compared to the memorable moments I saw.

00:28:09.039 --> 00:28:16.579
Lex was nice enough to let me catch some of your highlights.

00:28:16.579 --> 00:28:20.789
I'll make sure a few of them make it into your obituary.

00:28:20.789 --> 00:29:33.069
It was a classified Luther Court project called Prometheus,

00:29:33.069 --> 00:29:37.069
but now that a Brainiac freed could me begin to hack the firewall.

00:29:37.069 --> 00:29:43.960
You said the first time you saw Lana, she was standing in front of this radiator.

00:29:43.960 --> 00:29:48.960
Yeah, I think so, but I don't know what the building's heating system has to do with any of this.

00:29:48.960 --> 00:30:07.880
Whoa.

00:30:07.880 --> 00:30:10.880
Looks like Glana's got her very own secret stash.

00:30:10.880 --> 00:30:29.369
She obviously didn't want to leave any of the good stuff on my gigabytes.

00:30:29.369 --> 00:30:35.960
Why don't I feel like I'm cracking up in her diary?

00:30:35.960 --> 00:30:37.960
It might be the only way we can save her, Clark.

00:30:37.960 --> 00:30:47.440
Who's this guy?

00:30:47.440 --> 00:30:50.440
Edward Grohl. He's been with Luther Corp since the first meteor shower.

00:30:50.440 --> 00:30:52.440
If they gave out PhDs and all things,

00:30:52.440 --> 00:30:58.259
was alien, this guy would definitely have one.

00:30:58.259 --> 00:31:00.259
I know you were involved with Project Aries.

00:31:00.259 --> 00:31:04.259
But more importantly, I found out you designed Prometheus.

00:31:04.259 --> 00:31:06.259
I want to commend you.

00:31:06.259 --> 00:31:09.259
That is an amazing achievement.

00:31:09.259 --> 00:31:11.259
You must be mistaken, Mrs. Luther?

00:31:11.259 --> 00:31:13.259
It's Ms. Lang.

00:31:13.259 --> 00:31:15.259
That will never change.

00:31:15.259 --> 00:31:22.009
I promise, Doctor, I don't intend on destroying your technology.

00:31:22.009 --> 00:31:24.009
I want to put it to good use.

00:31:24.009 --> 00:31:27.009
I'm an academic. I hold a chair in biophysics at Metropysics

00:31:27.009 --> 00:31:29.009
of Metropolis University.

00:31:29.009 --> 00:31:32.009
Where you designed and built a metadermal skin graft

00:31:32.009 --> 00:31:34.009
that will not only sustain Lex's health,

00:31:34.009 --> 00:31:37.009
but will give him superhuman abilities.

00:31:37.009 --> 00:31:39.009
Superhuman abilities.

00:31:39.009 --> 00:31:40.009
Superhuman abilities?

00:31:40.009 --> 00:31:43.009
Have you taken up reading comic books?

00:31:43.009 --> 00:31:47.740
For someone intelligent enough

00:31:47.740 --> 00:31:51.740
to harness alien DNA into the ultimate power suit,

00:31:51.740 --> 00:31:53.740
you are dangerously naive.

00:31:53.740 --> 00:31:57.740
What good will your technology do in the hands of a madman?

00:31:57.740 --> 00:32:05.279
madman. You and I both know that Lex is too dangerous to wear it, but I can.

00:32:05.279 --> 00:32:10.130
I'm sorry, Miss Lang, I don't have time to discuss fictitious.

00:32:10.130 --> 00:32:13.130
If Lex ever puts on that suit, he will corrupt its power.

00:32:13.130 --> 00:32:17.130
He will become a god among men and the world will never recover.

00:32:17.130 --> 00:32:23.799
Do you want your legacy to be allowing Lex Luther to become the ultimate weapon?

00:32:23.799 --> 00:32:30.450
Do you want to be remembered for saving people's lives,

00:32:30.450 --> 00:32:34.829
for improving the human condition all over the world?

00:32:34.829 --> 00:32:39.250
I have a space in East Metron.

00:32:39.250 --> 00:32:41.250
Space in East Metropolis.

00:32:41.250 --> 00:32:44.250
In a warehouse on 95th in Bristol, you can set up your lab.

00:32:44.250 --> 00:32:48.490
It's not just me.

00:32:48.490 --> 00:32:50.490
Full of researchers. They'd never allow it.

00:32:50.490 --> 00:32:53.490
Tell them it was on Lex's orders.

00:32:53.490 --> 00:32:55.490
That he wanted me to be the guinea pig.

00:32:55.490 --> 00:33:00.210
It's not so far-fetched as it.

00:33:00.210 --> 00:33:09.000
I don't think she was kidnapped, Clark.

00:33:09.000 --> 00:33:15.579
Lana doesn't want to destroy the technology.

00:33:15.579 --> 00:33:18.579
She wants to use it on herself.

00:33:18.579 --> 00:33:40.970
Thank God. Her blood pressure is rising.

00:33:40.970 --> 00:33:42.970
For now.

00:33:42.970 --> 00:33:46.279
The machines.

00:33:46.279 --> 00:33:47.779
or what's keeping her alive.

00:33:47.779 --> 00:33:49.279
She's going to be fine.

00:33:49.279 --> 00:33:52.500
She has to be.

00:33:52.500 --> 00:33:59.500
Where's the Prometheus suit?

00:33:59.500 --> 00:34:00.500
Oh!

00:34:00.500 --> 00:34:01.500
Stop!

00:34:01.500 --> 00:34:03.500
Don't enter that chamber.

00:34:03.500 --> 00:34:05.500
Any contaminant could kill her.

00:34:05.500 --> 00:34:06.500
Her?

00:34:06.500 --> 00:34:17.699
Lana.

00:34:17.699 --> 00:34:19.699
It was Lex's orders.

00:34:19.699 --> 00:34:26.130
Prometheus must be destroyed.

00:34:26.130 --> 00:34:28.130
It's too late.

00:34:28.130 --> 00:34:35.349
You can't destroy the suit without murdering her.

00:34:35.349 --> 00:34:37.349
Lana Lang was born to be a martyr.

00:34:37.349 --> 00:34:39.349
No!

00:34:39.349 --> 00:34:49.210
You will never be able to help Luxluther again.

00:34:49.210 --> 00:35:34.579
You find her before she finds me.

00:35:34.579 --> 00:35:36.579
This woman is lethal.

00:35:36.579 --> 00:36:04.530
Lana, you gotta believe me.

00:36:04.530 --> 00:36:06.530
I didn't know you were in there.

00:36:06.530 --> 00:36:10.449
Yes, you did.

00:36:10.449 --> 00:36:15.719
I'm not here to hurt you, Tess.

00:36:15.719 --> 00:36:20.659
I'm here as your friend.

00:36:20.659 --> 00:36:24.659
My BFF, who tears open my safe with her bare hands and burns,

00:36:24.659 --> 00:36:26.659
all of my research.

00:36:26.659 --> 00:36:29.659
I think that you're stretching the definition of friendship just a little bit.

00:36:29.659 --> 00:36:34.380
bit.

00:36:34.380 --> 00:36:38.619
I don't want you to make the same mistake I did.

00:36:38.619 --> 00:36:42.820
I know how much you want to get revenge on Lex, and who can blame you?

00:36:42.820 --> 00:36:47.309
I have felt that exact same rage.

00:36:47.309 --> 00:36:52.230
He didn't implant a microchip into your brain.

00:36:52.230 --> 00:37:00.849
All that anger will lead you down a long tunnel that you will never find your way out of.

00:37:00.849 --> 00:37:05.110
Yeah, that's a really easy position to take when you're clad in an invincible suit.

00:37:05.110 --> 00:37:13.320
I didn't put the suit on for protection.

00:37:13.320 --> 00:37:15.420
I did it so that I could actually do some good in life.

00:37:15.440 --> 00:37:22.550
the world.

00:37:22.550 --> 00:37:25.550
You are an amazing woman, Tess.

00:37:25.550 --> 00:37:32.219
But it's hard to see when you're stuck in the dark shadow of an even darker man.

00:37:32.219 --> 00:37:37.489
Why do you think I want Lex gone?

00:37:37.489 --> 00:37:40.489
You may have gotten rid of the microchip.

00:37:40.489 --> 00:37:45.489
But every second that you are consumed by hate is another second.

00:37:45.489 --> 00:37:56.139
Lex is still in control of you.

00:37:56.139 --> 00:38:25.079
Don't be a victim anymore.

00:38:25.079 --> 00:38:28.079
Kent, what are you doing Rising before the Roosters?

00:38:28.079 --> 00:38:29.079
Couldn't sleep.

00:38:29.079 --> 00:38:42.929
Leave me up on the roof.

00:38:42.929 --> 00:38:47.960
Lana?

00:38:47.960 --> 00:38:48.960
I've been looking all over for you.

00:38:48.960 --> 00:38:49.960
Are you okay?

00:38:49.960 --> 00:38:51.960
I've never felt better, Clark.

00:38:51.960 --> 00:38:56.559
It's because you're wearing that suit, Lana.

00:38:56.559 --> 00:38:57.559
You have powers.

00:38:57.559 --> 00:39:00.559
And the last time that happened, it didn't end well.

00:39:00.559 --> 00:39:02.559
I'm different now.

00:39:02.559 --> 00:39:05.559
This time I've prepared myself.

00:39:05.559 --> 00:39:08.559
Those months that you were gone.

00:39:08.559 --> 00:39:10.559
Why didn't you tell me what you were doing?

00:39:10.559 --> 00:39:12.559
You would have never let me go through with it.

00:39:12.559 --> 00:39:14.559
Because it's dangerous, Lana.

00:39:14.559 --> 00:39:17.559
It's never been tested on humans.

00:39:17.559 --> 00:39:20.559
Give Lex credit where credit is due.

00:39:20.559 --> 00:39:22.559
When it comes to all things scientific,

00:39:22.559 --> 00:39:26.559
he's pulled off the impossible on more than one occasion.

00:39:26.559 --> 00:39:30.559
Clerk, you don't have to protect me anymore.

00:39:30.559 --> 00:39:32.559
You don't have to worry about me.

00:39:32.559 --> 00:39:34.559
How can you say that, Lana?

00:39:34.559 --> 00:39:36.559
We have no idea what's going to happen.

00:39:36.559 --> 00:39:38.559
Exactly.

00:39:38.559 --> 00:39:43.099
And that's why it's so important to live in the present.

00:39:43.099 --> 00:39:45.099
Whatever happened in the past,

00:39:45.099 --> 00:39:46.099
and what happened?

00:39:46.099 --> 00:39:49.099
Whatever happens in the future, it doesn't matter.

00:39:49.099 --> 00:39:51.099
It does matter, Lana.

00:39:51.099 --> 00:39:57.539
It matters if you get hurt.

00:39:57.539 --> 00:40:01.559
I know how much you care about me.

00:40:01.559 --> 00:40:05.510
You always have.

00:40:05.510 --> 00:40:07.510
That's why when I came back for Chloe's wedding,

00:40:07.510 --> 00:40:14.030
I didn't think we could be together.

00:40:14.030 --> 00:40:18.030
The last thing I wanted was to be some distraction in your life.

00:40:18.030 --> 00:40:19.030
You're not a distraction.

00:40:19.030 --> 00:40:27.110
You never were.

00:40:27.110 --> 00:40:32.400
I'm not anymore.

00:40:32.400 --> 00:40:35.400
Nothing can hurt me anymore.

00:40:35.400 --> 00:40:37.400
You and I are equals now, and together,

00:40:37.400 --> 00:40:49.190
the world a better place.

00:40:49.190 --> 00:40:50.190
Unless that's not what you want.

00:40:50.190 --> 00:40:52.190
No, Lana, it's exactly what I want.

00:40:52.190 --> 00:40:57.460
It's a dream, Lana.

00:40:57.460 --> 00:41:06.949
We both know dreams normally don't come true.

00:41:06.949 --> 00:41:09.949
There's never been anything normal about us.

